Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.97,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)}Sea Charts and Fishmen
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.97,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Sea Charts and Fishmen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks suspiciously\Nlike a treasure map,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it seems to be pointing\Nto Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you have the nerve\Nto go through my personal belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my map, and it has\Nnothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are all these guys\Ndead? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter Zoro did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why weren't you here, Hachi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could have been\Nprevented had you been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it could have,\Nhad I only been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't here, so you\Ndon't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a slightly\Nsuspicious swordsman type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did see him, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me he wanted to see Arlong, so\NI gave him a ride to Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we don't\Nhave any need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to come straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Along, but if I had known\Nyou were going to be back so soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have kept him here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he said he was a guest and I thought I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should get him to the\Nvillage as fast as I could
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means if I could buy\Njust a little more time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep getting in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's so close to working out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugggh! Egh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, Dusak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one getting in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you get\Nfor messing with Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you really disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after you stole our ship and ran\Noff, Luffy had complete faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He trusts you completely, and you\Nhaven't even shown an ounce of guilt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you betray someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really that cold-hearted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I trust is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those dumb enough to be fooled deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to let you and your friends\Nruin eight long years of hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you became a\Npirate while you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, like you're gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Crap if I stay here, I'm\Na dead man special attack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.90,0:05:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just like something\Nyou'd think of. Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Tessnami killed Big Bro-O-Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wish came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You died at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I'm sorry for doubting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without question, you're our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason\NI joined this group.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's to buy\NCocoyashi Village from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just business, not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your end of the deal.\NI'll have those berries soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather cut my stomach open and die\Nthan rake a promise concerning money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of man I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it, Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a great woman she's become.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That witch killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up the pace, cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji's kicks must have\Nreally taken their toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to your other left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the building, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's almost like we're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are flying, you moron! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, they're successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome! We're here, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to pick up Nami. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you haven't found her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Usopp and Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp? Oh, no. Come\Non. We've got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:08:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dumbass has been caught by Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry before they kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro Usopp is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tommy murdered him!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.08,0:09:25.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,720)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)}{Cocoyashi Village,\NWest End of the Island - OG}West Coast,\NCocoyashi Village{PJ}
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.08,0:09:25.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,720)\c&HFBFBFB&\4a&HFF&}{Cocoyashi Village,\NWest End of the Island - OG}West Coast,\NCocoyashi Village{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up! What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The marines are here, we're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some survivors from\NKoza managed to contact
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the government and they\Ntold them what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the marines are here to rescue us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we get to leave this horrible place!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the infamous arlong park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the world coming to when pirate\Nskunk can set up such an opulent base?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our noble mission today\Nis one of extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must rescue the survivors\Nof the town of gosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which was savagely destroyed\Nby the arlong pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am left to wonder would our\Nbrand of swift and terrible justice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow us to simply overlook the decadent\Nfortress of these unchecked brutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir? No. Sir. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our unit must annihilate\Narlong and his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for battle at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marine branch 77?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A newcomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have someone negotiate\Nwith the man in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If two million isn't enough to keep\Nthem from trying anything funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then kill every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The marines have opened fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he crushed a cannonball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those jaws are terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are the talks...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a bloodbath!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.70,0:11:21.66,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(518,479)\an8\bord3\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(1125,400)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(477,518,\1a&H00&)\t(4481,4522,\1a&HFF&)}Officer Chew\N(Kisser Fishman)\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:11:16.70,0:11:21.66,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(518,479)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(1125,400)\c&HFBFBFB&\4a&HFF&}Officer Chew\N(Kisser Fishman)\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to expend so much\Nenergy just to take out the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.58,0:11:28.54,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord3\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(302,400)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,478,\1a&H00&)}Officer Kuroobi\N(Ray Fishman)\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:11:23.58,0:11:28.54,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(302,400)\c&HFBFBFA&\4a&HFF&}Officer Kuroobi\N(Ray Fishman)\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What foolish humans they\Nare to pick a fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our own waters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those marines don't stand a chance\Nagainst three of our leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt that ship will make\Nit a full three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems that cannonball was a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire another!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a signal of open hostility!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never drop your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're dealing with fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mandel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand down! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of our longsmen, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Commodore Perona Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of Marines Branch No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,77 Allow me to elaborate You see, we are\Na somewhat well-known elite marine unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what\NI'm telling you, fish man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to live,\Nsurrender immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all this shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me there are\Nfish men under the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry to\Ninconvenience you like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we just took the liberty\Nof removing your rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You what, Commodore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I didn't hit\Nany of his vital organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just hypothetical, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one were to move a large reef\Ndirectly into a strong current,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you suppose would\Nhappen to the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, moving the whole reef?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it down over there, Hachi. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Commodore, a giant\Nwhirlpool's just appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rudder isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, we removed the rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now this rudderless ship is\Nheaded straight to the sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and so is hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to escape\NBarlong's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't even break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know everything about these\Nwaters, from the winds to the depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was quite easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With our expert knowledge of\Nthese waters, no one can beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, but let's not forget Nami's charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, they are excellent charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could persuade Nami to do\Nthis for all the world's oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would be the undisputed\Nrulers of the sea forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Nami's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, she could be critical in\Nthe creation of the Arlong Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a shame. A shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He promised to let Nami\Nand Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go while she saves up a\Nhundred million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, you can't let her leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what we agreed to eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the kind of man who always keeps\Nmy promises when it comes to money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say another word and you'll regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, believe whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know what I saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami killed big bro\NUsopp! Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never in a million years\Nwould Nami kill Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't do that to her friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that about friends, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pest. Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just pathetic enough\Nto deserve each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I watched you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, Big Bro Usopp is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you kill\Nme and get your revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word to the wise fellas, because\Nof your friend's stupidity,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong is preparing to kill\NZoro along with his entire crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't care how monstrously\Nstrong you guys think you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're no match for the real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run away together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can it, Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time or place for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love is like a hurricane, so back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at me when I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, where is Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the fishes. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A swordsman striking a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starting to piss me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone had stopped me\Nthat easily, I'd be mad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say whatever I want, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pal's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quit your bickering and\Nleave while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You outsiders have no right to\Nbutt into this island's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I got\Nclose to you idiots was
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that I could rob you\Nof everything you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that you're broke, it\Nlooks like the dream's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go, take your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, find a navigator dumb enough\Nto join you and go to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue on your quest to find\Nthe One Piece or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave here, you're an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro Luffy sleepy\Nsleep at a time like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the middle of the road\Nwell i'm pretty tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna butt into\Ntheir affairs i'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interested but I'm not\Nleaving either. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go ahead and die! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:17:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:18:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you thinking? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that\NArlong is out to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we know what Nami's really like,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there isn't a single good reason\Nwhy we should stay on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to cut our reunion\Nshort, but I won't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My role as guide ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to deliberately\Nget myself killed. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we meet again, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, you guys! You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you still honestly believe\Nthat Nami could have killed Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:18:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When she did that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When she did that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami stabbed her own hand to\Nmake it look like she stabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she did that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a good thing she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'd be fish\Nfood right now for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A manly man like me can't just turn\Ntail and run after being saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I gotta hurry and find Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait... Is that him up\Nahead? It is! It's Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Nami didn't kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought of her as kind of a small
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-time crook who wouldn't\Neven watch a guy die,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let alone kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe she just snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not small-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she all you think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to trash a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just resting a little, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me that\Npouring over a treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,map after wrecking a\Nhouse is how you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not fooling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Vice up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell me anything, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something happened to make me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys. Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I met some captain guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seemed kind of liar-ish, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would hit her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that someone\Nactually showed up for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That word means pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It breaks her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Nami do all this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Zoro and I did that. No, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here too. Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of these days, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you just made a\Nfull recovery. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, we kind of\Nheard you were dead, killed by Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid Johnny, he was spouting\Nnonsense that entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in a way, it is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm alive, cause you see,\Nshe actually saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like she's got\Nsome sort of hidden motive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for hanging out with a\Nbunch of renegade fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.46,0:22:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.37,0:22:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna destroy Arlong Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hang on just a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think we better find out\Nwhat's going on with Nami first?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use either way. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you guys do, Arlong's\Nrule won't come to an end. No, Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's big sister. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder she's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean that it's no use?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get yourselves involved\Nin what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And leave poor Nami alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.14,0:22:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that doesn't get you to\Nleave, I don't know what will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.05,0:22:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a marine ship at the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Bridge 16th ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe headquarters is finally taking\Naction after what happened to Branch 77.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Colonel Nezumi of Branch 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Genzo, please step up\Nand make it snappy. Yes, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me to Nami's house\Nat once. Nami? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Nwhat's going on, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.88,0:23:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watched the sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I began to wonder What could be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.98,0:24:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the reason it's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings,\Nget them to come back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.88,0:24:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause they're everything I want will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pack these arms around my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.14,0:24:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pull us back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way.

